          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "儿子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "飞不起来就飞不起来嘛，谁叫他那么胖！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-04-bowser-cannot-fly-back_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "呵呵！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-04-bowser-cannot-fly-back_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "儿子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你选容易回来的人就行。游戏里有一些属性，如力量、敏捷，像酷霸王力量就大！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-04-bowser-cannot-fly-back_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "除了力量、敏捷，你觉得还有其它吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-04-bowser-cannot-fly-back_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "还有反应。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-04-bowser-cannot-fly-back_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "儿子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "反应也是敏捷的一种，敏捷越高反应越快。",
